{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":11},"Madres paralelas (Parallel Mothers)","Dos mujeres coinciden en una habitación de hospital donde van a dar a luz. Ambas están solteras y se quedaron embarazadas por accidente. Janis, de mediana edad, no se arrepiente y está exultante. La otra, Ana, una adolescente, está asustada, arrepentida y traumatizada. Janis intenta animarla mientras pasean por los pasillos del hospital. Las pocas palabras que intercambien en esas horas crearán un vínculo muy estrecho entre las dos, que por casualidad se desarrolla y se complica, afectando a sus vidas de forma decisiva. (The story of two mothers who bond in unexpected way after giving birth the same day.)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"motherhood","collective trauma","gender discrimination","homosociality","superior-employee relationship","high rank employment","extended family",{"type":12,"id":13,"slug":14,"title":15,"release":18,"filmType":22,"directors":23,"genre":59,"media":62,"synopsis":65,"production":68,"characters":71,"roles":112,"awards":155,"tags":3},"Film","ES2021_044","es2021-044-madres-paralelas",{"native":16,"english":17},"Madres paralelas","Parallel Mothers",{"type":19,"date":20,"year":21},"Theatrical release","2021-10-08",2021,"Fiction film",[24],{"id":25,"slug":26,"name":25,"birthYear":27,"deathYear":28,"gender":29,"nationality":30,"awards":31},"Pedro Almodóvar","pedro-almodovar",1949,0,"Male identifying","Spain",[32,38,45,51,55],{"film":33,"year":21,"award":35,"category":36,"result":37},{"slug":14,"title":34},{"native":16},"Premios Goya","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":39,"year":43,"award":35,"category":36,"result":44},{"slug":40,"title":41},"es2019-003-dolor-y-gloria",{"native":42},"Dolor y gloria",2019,"Awarded",{"film":46,"year":50,"award":35,"category":36,"result":37},{"slug":47,"title":48},"es2016-005-julieta",{"native":49},"Julieta",2016,{"film":52,"year":50,"award":54,"category":36,"result":37},{"slug":47,"title":53},